1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:05,430
Spring Arrives

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:09,400
Drawing About Safe Living

3
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:12,860
When plum blossoms fade, spring arrives.

4
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:31,360
UNICEF Vietnam and <i>Thieu Nien Tien Phong</i> newspaper just concluded children's drawing contest with theme: <i>I want to live safely.</i>

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:17,630
Sky is increasingly blue.

6
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:23,900
Yellow sunshine is increasingly bright.

7
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,260
Garden trees sprout new branches again.

8
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:34,760
Then garden trees bloom.

9
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:48,560
Contest launched from April 2001 to raise accident prevention awareness for children.

10
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:39,900
Fragrant pomelo flowers.

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:45,960
Sweet longan flowers.

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:51,600
Areca flowers pass by.

13
00:00:49,640 --> 00:01:04,760
Within 4 months, Organizing Committee received 50,000 drawings of many children nationwide.

14
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:59,360
Garden trees again full of bird sounds and flying birds.

15
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:08,530
Chicks chirp quickly.

16
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:15,680
Some award-winning drawings such as:

17
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:16,460
Clever frogs.

18
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:34,840
<i>Wearing helmet is best</i> (Hoang Minh Uyen, 10 years old, special prize),

19
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:22,400
Young red-scarf guides.

20
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:30,430
Old men with long beards singing seriously.

21
00:01:30,430 --> 00:01:38,260
Young cuckoo birds happy with garden trees and other birds.

22
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:51,980
<i>My family is protected safely</i> (Ta Bich Ngoc, 9 years old, first prize),

23
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:48,330
But in childish poetry, in mind still bright white plum blossom image,

24
00:01:48,330 --> 00:02:01,500
But in childish poetry, in mind still bright white plum blossom image, knows blooming at end of winter to announce spring coming.

25
00:01:54,800 --> 00:02:15,680
<i>Children should not ride bicycles on street</i> (Nguyen Thuy Mai Dung, 7 years old, third prize).

26
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:30,440
60 drawings selected to hang at exhibition

27
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:44,160
(among them 46 award-winning drawings) made a beautiful art room:

28
00:02:45,120 --> 00:03:07,440
drawings have bright colors, clear composition, innocent ideas, pure yet profound.

